></div><div class="column is-4"><div class="why-item"><div class="icon-why-item"><div class="why-icon_icon"><i class="img-sprites icon-easy"></i></div></div><div class="title is-4">Works on All Devices</div> Our SoundCloud to MP3 converter works on Windows, Mac, Android, and iOS. You do not need to install any software. Simply use your browser to download SoundCloud music instantly.</div></div><div class="column is-4"><div class="why-item"><div class="icon-why-item"><div class="why-icon_icon"><i class="img-sprites icon-free"></i></div></div><div class="title is-4">Free and Unlimited Downloads</div> SoundCloudMate is completely free to use with unlimited downloads. We only display a few ads to keep the service running, allowing you to download SoundCloud MP3 files without restrictions.</div></div></div></div></section></div></div><div class="how-section" id="how-section"><section class="section"><div class="container"><div class="columns"><div class="column"><div class="why-heading"><h2 class="title why-title is-3">How to <span class="text-primary">Download SoundCloud Songs</span> with SoundCloudMate</h2><div class="why-intro">Download SoundCloud songs and playlists in MP3 format for free using SoundCloudMate.</div></div></div></div><div class="columns"><div class="item column is-4"><div class="des"><h3 class="title is-4"><span class="step-count">1</span>Find Songs</h3><p>From <a href="https://soundcloud.com/" class="open-externallink" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener noreferrer">SoundCloud</a>, copy the song or playlist URL by clicking Share and selecting Copy Link.</p></div></div><div class="item column is-4"><div class="des"><h3 class="title is-4"><span class="step-count">2</span>Paste Link</h3><p>Paste the SoundCloud URL in the input box above and click the Download MP3 button.</p></div></div><div class="item column is-4"><div class="des"><h3 class="title is-4"><span class="step-count">3</span>Download MP3</h3><p>Click the Download MP3 button and the track will be saved to your device automatically.</p></div></div></div></div></section></div><div class="how-section"><section class="section"><div class="container"><div class="columns"><div class="column"><div class="why-heading"><h2 class="title why-title is-3">SoundCloudMate - <span class="text-primary">Best SoundCloud Downloader</span></h2><div class="why-intro">Key Features of SoundCloudMate Soundcloud Downloader</div></div></div></div><div class="columns"><div class="column"><h3 class="title why-title is-4">SoundCloud Downloader - Convert & Download SoundCloud to MP3 for Free</h3><p><b>SoundCloudMate</b> is the best SoundCloud downloader that allows you to convert and download SoundCloud songs and playlists in MP3 format without losing quality.</p><p>Download Soundcloud tracks directly to your phone, PC, or tablet using your browser. No need to install any software. Supports Windows, macOS, iPhone, Android, and more.</p><b>Key Features of SoundCloudMate</b><ul class="ol-decorated"><li>Fast and Reliable: Download SoundCloud tracks instantly without waiting.</li><li>Supports All Devices: Works on Windows, Mac, Android, and iOS without issues.</li><li>100% Web-Based: No software installation is required, just use your browser.</li><li>Unlimited Downloads: Save as many SoundCloud MP3 files as you need.</li></ul><h3 class="title why-title is-4">How to Download Songs from SoundCloud?</h3><ul class="ol-decorated"><li>Copy the SoundCloud track or playlist link from the Share button.</li><li>Go to SoundCloudMate and paste the copied link into the search box.</li><li>Click the Download MP3 button to start the conversion.</li><li>Save the SoundCloud MP3 file to your device for offline listening.</li></ul><h3 class="title why-title is-4">Why SoundCloudMate is the Best SoundCloud Downloader?</h3><ul class="ol-decorated"><li>Simple and Easy to Use: Just copy, paste, and download in one click.</li><li>High-Quality MP3: Get the best audio quality with 320kbps downloads.</li><li>No Registration Needed: Start downloading without signing up or logging in.</li><li>Secure and Private: No personal data collection or stored files.</li><li>Accessible Anywhere: Use on mobile, tablet, or desktop without compatibility issues.</li></ul><p>Start using <b>SoundCloudMate</b> today and download your favorite SoundCloud songs for free!</p></div></div></div></section></div><div class="faq-section" id="faq-section" itemscope itemType="https://schema.org/FAQPage"><section class="section"><div class="container" style="border:0;"><div class="columns"><div class="column"><div class="why-heading"><h2 class="title why-title is-3">Frequently Asked Questions</h2></div></div></div><div class="columns"><div class="column"><div id="faq-accordion" class="accordion"><div class="card-faq" itemScope itemProp="mainEntity" itemType="https://schema.org/Question"><div class="card-header"><h3 class="card-title" itemProp="name"><div class="card-toggle">Why Use SoundCloudMate as Your SoundCloud Downloader?</div></h3></div><div class="card-collapse collapse" itemScope itemProp="acceptedAnswer" itemType="https://schema.org/Answer"><div class="card-body"><p itemProp="text">According to user reviews, SoundCloudMate is the fastest, most reliable, and highest-quality <a href="/"><b>SoundCloud to MP3</b></a> downloader. Our tool allows you to download SoundCloud songs and playlists for free with no restrictions or software installations.</p></div></div></div><div class="card-faq" itemScope itemProp="mainEntity" itemType="https://schema.org/Question"><div class="card-header"><h3 class="card-title" itemProp="name"><div class="card-toggle">How to Download SoundCloud Songs to Your Computer?</div></h3></div><div class="card-collapse collapse" itemScope itemProp="acceptedAnswer" itemType="https://schema.org/Answer"><div class="card-body"><p itemProp="text">To download SoundCloud songs on PC, copy the SoundCloud track link, paste it into the SoundCloudMate downloader, and click the Download MP3 button. Your file will be saved automatically in your Downloads folder.</p></div></div></div><div class="card-faq" itemScope itemProp="mainEntity" itemType="https://schema.org/Question"><div class="card-header"><h3 class="card-title" itemProp="name"><div class="card-toggle">How to Download SoundCloud Songs on Android?</div></h3></div><div class="card-collapse collapse" itemScope itemProp="acceptedAnswer" itemType="https://schema.org/Answer"><div class="card-body"><p itemProp="text">To download SoundCloud to MP3 on Android, open your mobile browser, visit SoundLoadMate.com, paste the track link, and tap Download MP3 to save it directly to your device.</p></div></div></div><div class="card-faq" itemScope itemProp="mainEntity" itemType="https://schema.org/Question"><div class="card-header"><h3 class="card-title" itemProp="name"><div class="card-toggle">How to Download SoundCloud Songs in 320kbps MP3?</div></h3></div><div class="card-collapse collapse" itemScope itemProp="acceptedAnswer" itemType="https://schema.org/Answer"><div class="card-body"><p itemProp="text">With SoundCloudMate, you can download high-quality MP3 files (320kbps) without compromising sound quality. Just paste the SoundCloud song URL and press Download MP3.</p></div></div></div><div class="card-faq" itemScope itemProp="mainEntity" itemType="https://schema.org/Question"><div class="card-header"><h3 class="card-title" itemProp="name"><div class="card-toggle">How to Download SoundCloud Songs on iPhone (iOS)?</div></h3></div><div class="card-collapse collapse" itemScope itemProp="acceptedAnswer" itemType="https://schema.org/Answer"><div class="card-body"><p itemProp="text">For <b>iOS 13+</b>, download SoundCloud MP3 files directly via Safari. Open SoundCloudMate, paste the track link and tap <b>Download MP3</b>. For <b>iOS 12 or older</b>, install <a rel="nofollow" href="https://apps.apple.com/us/app/documents-by-readdle/id364901807" target="_blank"><b>Documents by Readdle</b></a>, open its browser, visit SoundCloudMate, paste the link, and download. Move the MP3 file to the <b>Files app</b> or your music player.</p></div></div></div><div class="card-faq" itemScope itemProp="mainEntity" itemType="https://schema.org/Question"><div class="card-header"><h3 class="card-title" itemProp="name"><div class="card-toggle">How to Download SoundCloud Songs Online Without Software?</div></h3></div><div class="card-collapse collapse" itemScope itemProp="acceptedAnswer" itemType="https://schema.org/Answer"><div class="card-body"><p itemProp="text">SoundCloudMate is an online tool, meaning you don’t need to install any software. Just visit the website, paste your song or playlist link, and start downloading.</p></div></div></div><div class="card-faq" itemScope itemProp="mainEntity" itemType="https://schema.org/Question"><div class="card-header"><h3 class="card-title" itemProp="name"><div class="card-toggle">Can I Save SoundCloud Songs on My Phone?</div></h3></div><div class="card-collapse collapse" itemScope itemProp="acceptedAnswer" itemType="https://schema.org/Answer"><div class="card-body"><p itemProp="text">Yes, after downloading SoundCloud MP3, the file will be saved in your device’s Downloads folder or Music app, depending on your phone settings.</p></div></div></div><div class="card-faq" itemScope itemProp="mainEntity" itemType="https://schema.org/Question"><div class="card-header"><h3 class="card-title" itemProp="name"><div class="card-toggle">Can I Download Private Tracks from SoundCloud?</div></h3></div><div class="card-collapse collapse" itemScope itemProp="acceptedAnswer" itemType="https://schema.org/Answer"><div class="card-body"><p itemProp="text">No, private tracks on SoundCloud cannot be downloaded unless the uploader has enabled the download option. Private tracks are restricted and only accessible to the uploader and users with a direct link.</p></div></div></div><div class="card-faq" itemScope itemProp="mainEntity" itemType="https://schema.org/Question"><div class="card-header"><h3 class="card-title" itemProp="name"><div class="card-toggle">Does SoundCloudMate Store Downloaded Songs or Keep Copies?</div></h3></div><div class="card-collapse collapse" itemScope itemProp="acceptedAnswer" itemType="https://schema.org/Answer"><div class="card-body"><p itemProp="text">No, SoundCloudMate does not store any downloaded files. All downloads happen directly from SoundCloud’s servers, ensuring complete privacy and security.</p></div></div></div><div class="card-faq" itemScope itemProp="mainEntity" itemType="https://schema.org/Question"><div class="card-header"><h3 class="card-title" itemProp="name"><div class="card-toggle">What Formats Does SoundCloudMate Support?</div></h3></div><div class="card-collapse collapse" itemScope itemProp="acceptedAnswer" itemType="https://schema.org/Answer"><div class="card-body"><p itemProp="text">Currently, SoundCloudMate converts SoundCloud to MP3 format, which is compatible with all devices.</p></div></div></div><div class="card-faq" itemScope itemProp="mainEntity" itemType="https://schema.org/Question"><div class="card-header"><h3 class="card-title" itemProp="name"><div class="card-toggle">Can I Download SoundCloud Songs Without a SoundCloud Account?</div></h3></div><div class="card-collapse collapse" itemScope itemProp="acceptedAnswer" itemType="https://schema.org/Answer"><div class="card-body"><p itemProp="text">Yes! SoundCloudMate does not require a SoundCloud account to download songs. Paste the track or playlist link, click Download MP3, and save the file.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="faq-contact text-center"><h3 class="title is-4 pt-5">Do you have any questions to answer?</h3><div class="section-intro">Please contact us <a rel="nofollow" href="/contact.html">here</a>. We will reply to you as quickly as possible.</div></div></div></div></div></section></div></main><div id="dlModal" class="modal"><div class="modal-content"><div class="modal-body" id="ad-content"><p style="text-align:ce